WEBVTT

00:19.954 --> 00:24.258
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.258 --> 00:28.929
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.929 --> 00:36.028
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.603 --> 00:41.475
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.475 --> 00:52.252
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.252 --> 00:54.355
Mamoritai

00:54.355 --> 00:56.590
Shinjitai

00:56.590 --> 01:00.828
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.828 --> 01:05.299
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.299 --> 01:09.470
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.470 --> 01:13.140
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:13.140 --> 01:21.639
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:30.624 --> 01:33.559
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:34.695 --> 01:37.865
It's in the direction
of the Emperor's palace!

01:37.865 --> 01:40.234
The fire is probably
spreading from...

01:40.234 --> 01:42.725
the Seiryou quarters
to the inner palace.

01:43.237 --> 01:45.535
I've sensed this presence
before...

01:45.639 --> 01:47.607
East Third Palace!

01:51.412 --> 01:53.614
You came up with a good idea...

01:53.614 --> 01:55.649
asking the demons
who roam the night.

01:55.649 --> 01:58.318
If the fire was the
work of a demon,

01:58.318 --> 02:01.310
I was thinking that
they might know something.

02:04.124 --> 02:06.149
What's that?

02:09.596 --> 02:12.690
Search for the Foreign Shadow

02:30.918 --> 02:34.555
- Hey!
- What did you do that for, Mokkun?!

02:34.555 --> 02:38.192
Well, I was making sure
that you were not asleep.

02:38.192 --> 02:41.628
I'm not sleeping! I'm doing
my work now, aren't I?

02:41.628 --> 02:43.397
Work...

02:43.397 --> 02:45.966
You battle ox monsters
at night,

02:45.966 --> 02:48.802
and grind ink in the day...

02:48.802 --> 02:51.771
Ordinary things are important too!

02:52.506 --> 02:55.609
That's what Father and
Grandfather always say.

02:55.609 --> 02:58.840
You listen to them when
it comes to such things?

02:59.246 --> 03:04.445
There are those who skip the work
because they think it is pointless.

03:12.493 --> 03:15.587
Hey, about the monster
last night...

03:16.730 --> 03:20.029
Yeah, where could it
have come from...

03:23.637 --> 03:25.127
Go!

03:26.440 --> 03:29.176
Even Guren's flames
couldn't burn it,

03:29.176 --> 03:31.337
and it disappeared somewhere...

03:36.650 --> 03:40.484
Well, with injuries like that,
it probably didn't survive...

03:49.496 --> 03:52.032
Masahiro, have you finished?

03:52.032 --> 03:54.168
Yes! I'll be done soon!

03:54.168 --> 03:56.470
The astronomy department's
supply is running out.

03:56.470 --> 03:59.769
- So please send it there first.
- I understand.

04:00.507 --> 04:03.704
All right! I'll finish up quickly.

04:07.748 --> 04:10.273
Hand over that boy.

04:11.818 --> 04:12.886
Hand him over.

04:12.886 --> 04:16.557
The spiritual power hidden
within him is unrivalled.

04:16.557 --> 04:19.151
I will offer this prey
to my master.

04:19.960 --> 04:21.695
His master?

04:21.695 --> 04:26.189
In other words, there's another
ayakashi pulling the strings?

04:31.939 --> 04:34.608
I've finished distributing
everything at last...

04:34.608 --> 04:37.168
Let's go home quickly.

04:40.180 --> 04:41.807
Strange...

04:42.449 --> 04:44.618
- What is it?
- Well...

04:44.618 --> 04:47.387
I've just become very sleepy
all of a sudden...

04:47.387 --> 04:50.224
You've been overworking
yourself.

04:50.224 --> 04:54.394
I thought that it'd be fine
to overwork myself a little.

04:54.394 --> 04:56.862
Maybe... I'm really worn-out...

04:59.800 --> 05:03.237
All right, no one's around...

05:03.237 --> 05:06.473
Hey! Aren't we going home?

05:06.473 --> 05:09.209
Sorry, I'll get up soon.

05:09.209 --> 05:12.045
Let me know if someone
wants to come in.

05:12.045 --> 05:14.615
You're making me stand guard
for you while you nap?!

05:14.615 --> 05:18.142
Hey, Masahiro!
Geez, he's already asleep!

05:19.786 --> 05:21.688
Book archives...

05:21.688 --> 05:25.419
Seimei's grandson shouldn't
sleep in a place like this...

05:26.093 --> 05:28.357
Don't call me grandson...

05:36.169 --> 05:39.400
...Huh?

05:39.973 --> 05:43.777
Oh, it's Lord Michinaga's house.

05:43.777 --> 05:45.979
I haven't been here
since the fire...

05:45.979 --> 05:48.140
I wonder how Akiko's doing...

05:49.549 --> 05:51.915
It seems like she's
already gone to bed.

05:52.185 --> 05:53.675
A dog?

05:54.421 --> 05:58.721
That's strange, a dog shouldn't
be able to get into the house...

06:02.129 --> 06:04.563
This feeling is the same
as the last time!

06:09.403 --> 06:11.132
Akiko...

06:12.306 --> 06:14.706
The demonic presence has
become stronger.

06:17.778 --> 06:19.871
That's where it came
from the other time!

06:21.381 --> 06:23.508
T-That's?!

06:26.720 --> 06:29.154
What... is that?

06:39.733 --> 06:41.325
Akiko!

06:41.735 --> 06:44.795
My legs...
I can't move my legs!

06:45.138 --> 06:47.003
I've found you...

06:49.142 --> 06:51.778
Oh no! Don't you touch Akiko!

06:51.778 --> 06:54.440
Someone! Is anyone around?!

06:56.550 --> 06:59.519
Mokkun! Mokkun,
where are you?!

06:59.519 --> 07:03.256
This spiritual power is suitable...

07:03.256 --> 07:06.259
Run away, Akiko!
Don't just stand there!

07:06.259 --> 07:07.894
Mokkun, where are you?!

07:07.894 --> 07:12.058
The long-haired... with this...

07:13.266 --> 07:16.531
- Why...
- Masahiro...

07:16.703 --> 07:19.433
Gu... Guren!

07:23.143 --> 07:24.838
Masahiro...

07:25.712 --> 07:27.373
Masahiro!

07:27.848 --> 07:30.009
Pull yourself together,
Masahiro!

07:33.186 --> 07:35.455
Are you all right, Masahiro?

07:35.455 --> 07:37.719
Oh... Mokkun...

07:39.159 --> 07:42.322
You were tossing and
turning. What happened?

07:43.997 --> 07:47.100
I think... I had a dream...

07:47.100 --> 07:49.500
A dream... What kind of dream?

07:50.170 --> 07:51.899
It was...

07:52.606 --> 07:56.804
at Lord Michinaga's house
at East Third Street...

07:58.278 --> 07:59.846
That's it!

07:59.846 --> 08:02.082
I saw the true form
of the ayakashi...

08:02.082 --> 08:03.984
that had attacked Akiko!

08:03.984 --> 08:06.316
- At the time of the fire?
- Yes.

08:06.586 --> 08:08.884
It tried to attack Akiko again.

08:08.955 --> 08:11.158
Why did I have
such a dream...

08:11.158 --> 08:13.490
There's meaning behind
the dreams of onmyouji.

08:13.527 --> 08:17.964
Especially in the dreams of
people who have the second sight.

08:20.066 --> 08:24.271
Give me a detailed description
of the demon you saw.

08:24.271 --> 08:26.006
Okay...

08:26.006 --> 08:29.576
Its body was large but
resembled that of a rat...

08:29.576 --> 08:31.878
and its head was like
that of a turtle...

08:31.878 --> 08:34.608
Its voice was like
a howling dog...

08:35.048 --> 08:37.651
I can't figure out with
just that information...

08:37.651 --> 08:40.554
Is it another demon
that you don't know,

08:40.554 --> 08:42.715
just like yesterday's
ox demon?

08:43.256 --> 08:46.919
- Come, let's ask Seimei!
- What?!

08:49.963 --> 08:53.296
What is this...

08:55.435 --> 08:57.504
Oh, this is the Sengaikyou.

08:57.504 --> 08:59.206
Sengaikyou?

08:59.206 --> 08:59.439
Sengaikyou Volume 3
Sengaikyou?

08:59.439 --> 08:59.906
Sengaikyou Volume 3

08:59.906 --> 09:02.309
Sengaikyou Volume 3
It's a book from the
Tang empire,

09:02.309 --> 09:05.078
Sengaikyou Volume 3
a country in the far west
beyond the ocean.

09:05.078 --> 09:07.080
Sengaikyou Volume 3
It describes the demons
and fairies...

09:07.080 --> 09:09.015
Sengaikyou Volume 3
of the mountains and
rivers over there...

09:09.015 --> 09:09.449
of the mountains and
rivers over there...

09:09.449 --> 09:11.184
Beyond the ocean?!

09:11.184 --> 09:14.287
That's it! If they are
foreign monsters,

09:14.287 --> 09:16.847
it's not surprising
I don't know them!

09:17.958 --> 09:18.725
Sengaikyou Volume 17

09:18.725 --> 09:20.861
Sengaikyou Volume 17
It looks like there's
a continuation to this.

09:20.861 --> 09:21.862
It looks like there's
a continuation to this.

09:21.862 --> 09:23.797
- All right!
- What do you plan to do?

09:23.797 --> 09:26.630
Find all the volumes and
read them, of course!

09:30.170 --> 09:32.739
- Masahiro!
- Father!

09:32.739 --> 09:34.774
You haven't gone home yet?

09:34.774 --> 09:37.010
There's something I want
to investigate...

09:37.010 --> 09:40.347
I would like to stay
for the night if it's okay.

09:40.347 --> 09:42.549
You want to stay here
for the night?

09:42.549 --> 09:46.319
Yes, please inform Mother
on my behalf.

09:46.319 --> 09:50.016
- Well, it's fine...
- I'll take my leave then.

10:00.033 --> 10:01.635
Yoshimasa...

10:01.635 --> 10:05.839
you left the Sengaikyou there
on purpose, didn't you?

10:05.839 --> 10:08.608
What? What do you mean?

10:08.608 --> 10:12.245
- Thanks for the help.
- Hey! Let's start, Mokkun!

10:12.245 --> 10:13.769
All right!

10:14.881 --> 10:17.217
Mokkun?

10:17.217 --> 10:22.553
That's Touda, the most
despised of all the shikigami...

10:23.323 --> 10:26.359
Masahiro is not afraid
of Touda...

10:26.359 --> 10:30.796
Being of that high caliber, he
truly is the grandson of Seimei.

10:35.802 --> 10:37.599
Isn't it this one?

10:38.939 --> 10:41.601
- Look! It's this!
- Which one?!

10:42.776 --> 10:43.310
Gouetsu

10:43.310 --> 10:45.278
Gouetsu
The ox-like demon!

10:45.278 --> 10:48.548
Gouetsu
It's called "Go..."

10:48.548 --> 10:48.682
Gouetsu

10:48.682 --> 10:51.751
Gouetsu
I can't read it. I don't
know this character...

10:51.751 --> 10:51.885
I can't read it. I don't
know this character...

10:51.885 --> 10:55.651
That's... Gouetsu, I think...

10:56.723 --> 10:59.326
This mountain is
400 km wide,

10:59.326 --> 11:01.861
and there's a beast
at the peak...

11:01.861 --> 11:06.766
Its form is like an ox with
a white body and four horns,

11:06.766 --> 11:10.463
and its coarse coat
is like straw...

11:10.537 --> 11:13.631
- This is it!
- It's the one from yesterday!

11:13.873 --> 11:17.172
There're foreign shadows
in the capital after all!

11:17.210 --> 11:19.145
Next is the demon
from your dream!

11:19.145 --> 11:21.170
- Go on!
- Yes!

11:39.633 --> 11:39.666
Banban

11:39.666 --> 11:41.334
Banban
It's this one!
I saw it in my dream!

11:41.334 --> 11:42.096
It's this one!
I saw it in my dream!

11:42.369 --> 11:42.702
Banban

11:42.702 --> 11:44.304
Banban
Banban...

11:45.872 --> 11:47.474
Did you find it?

11:47.474 --> 11:50.010
I think it's this
demon called Banban!

11:50.010 --> 11:54.280
Its body is like a rat, with
a head of a snapping turtle.

11:54.280 --> 11:56.214
And the voice...

11:56.783 --> 11:58.808
of a howling dog...

11:59.953 --> 12:02.822
That means your dream
was correct.

12:02.822 --> 12:06.192
Foreign demons that crossed
the ocean from the far west...

12:06.192 --> 12:10.030
Monsters beyond the
imagination...

12:10.030 --> 12:12.328
So what are you
going to do?

12:12.465 --> 12:16.162
I must search for
that monster, Banban.

12:17.237 --> 12:20.604
How are you going to find it?
The capital is huge.

12:22.709 --> 12:26.279
I'll catch the minor demons
in town and ask them.

12:26.279 --> 12:28.770
They should have sensed it too.

12:29.115 --> 12:31.709
They must be holding their
breaths and hiding away!

12:45.265 --> 12:48.200
We've finally arrived at
the outskirts of the capital.

12:48.702 --> 12:52.739
But I'm sure they're here.
I can feel their presence.

12:52.739 --> 12:56.042
They're trying their best
to hide their auras though...

12:56.042 --> 12:58.945
Looks like there are
quite a few of them here.

12:58.945 --> 13:01.214
We won't be able to
find them easily...

13:01.214 --> 13:04.012
if they're hiding in
a place like this.

13:05.985 --> 13:08.681
Well, where could they be?

13:10.056 --> 13:13.719
This place is full of dust...

13:16.096 --> 13:17.688
Are you okay?

13:21.801 --> 13:24.270
Oh! M-Mokkun?

13:24.270 --> 13:26.973
I'm fine. I'll go on
like this...

13:26.973 --> 13:28.770
If you say so...

13:35.248 --> 13:36.738
It's the grandson!

13:39.652 --> 13:41.121
It's the grandson!

13:41.121 --> 13:43.857
Do you know...
That's Seimei's grandson!

13:43.857 --> 13:47.627
He's thirteen, isn't he?
He came of age pretty late.

13:47.627 --> 13:51.256
Seimei still has such
a young grandson?

13:52.198 --> 13:56.169
It seems that he's being
made to run errands.

13:56.169 --> 13:59.272
- He's still a trainee, right?
- What!

13:59.272 --> 14:01.775
What? So he's nothing
much then.

14:01.775 --> 14:06.269
I guess being Seimei's grandson
doesn't mean anything.

14:07.580 --> 14:11.851
Curb your temper. Don't be
provoked by their words.

14:11.851 --> 14:13.720
I know that!

14:13.720 --> 14:16.086
What's that mononoke
riding on his shoulder?

14:16.189 --> 14:19.259
It's a shikigami. Even someone
like him owns one?

14:19.259 --> 14:21.861
I've been searching for
you guys since yesterday.

14:21.861 --> 14:23.795
I have something to ask you!

14:25.198 --> 14:28.334
Mokkun? What's wrong?

14:28.334 --> 14:30.359
Get away at once!

14:41.414 --> 14:45.051
- He's weak after all.
- Weak! Weak!

14:45.051 --> 14:47.153
Is it fine for him
to be so helpless?

14:47.153 --> 14:49.621
And to think he's
the grandson...

14:54.594 --> 14:57.363
Mokkun! You escaped
by yourself!

14:57.363 --> 14:59.966
I did warn you to run away.

14:59.966 --> 15:01.991
Didn't you hear me?

15:03.269 --> 15:05.305
Hey, have you guys seen...

15:05.305 --> 15:08.141
any unfamiliar monsters
around lately?

15:08.141 --> 15:10.176
- What?
- Well...

15:10.176 --> 15:12.245
You know something,
don't you?

15:12.245 --> 15:15.078
We came here to find
out more about this.

15:16.049 --> 15:17.710
What is it?

15:19.319 --> 15:21.287
Well, if we tell you,
what will you do?!

15:21.287 --> 15:24.157
Seek them out and
exorcise them, of course!

15:24.157 --> 15:27.594
- Exorcise them?!
- Can you do that?!

15:27.594 --> 15:29.562
Have some faith in him...

15:29.629 --> 15:32.532
He may not be much now.
But he's Seimei's grandson...

15:32.532 --> 15:35.435
and will probably become
a great onmyouji in future.

15:35.435 --> 15:37.096
Mokkun...

15:38.838 --> 15:43.109
I-I-I saw a demon
which looked like an ox!

15:43.109 --> 15:47.205
It killed many of my fellow
demons near the Rashou gate.

15:47.347 --> 15:49.949
That must have been
Gouetsu.

15:49.949 --> 15:54.754
I saw one that hid its form
in black smoke.

15:54.754 --> 15:57.891
It chased my fellow demon
into one of the buildings...

15:57.891 --> 15:59.726
you humans treasure
so much...

15:59.726 --> 16:04.527
- Into the palace?
- Yes. It...

16:05.632 --> 16:08.201
When my comrade
was cornered,

16:08.201 --> 16:11.364
and realized that
it was hopeless...

16:12.305 --> 16:17.277
It gathered up its last strength
to burn its own body...

16:17.277 --> 16:20.269
He did that to warn us
to run away.

16:23.216 --> 16:25.685
So that's why the palace
caught fire.

16:25.685 --> 16:27.854
Banban was the one
who cornered it.

16:27.854 --> 16:28.821
Yes.

16:28.821 --> 16:33.224
We escaped here so that
it won't be able to find us.

16:33.326 --> 16:36.659
No, the one I saw
was different...

16:37.196 --> 16:39.790
It was even more terrifying.

16:40.500 --> 16:42.365
A demon more terrifying?

16:42.435 --> 16:46.205
It could be the one that Gouetsu
referred to as his master...

16:46.205 --> 16:49.309
Describe it in detail!
What demon did you see?

16:49.309 --> 16:52.472
It was... what I saw
that time was...

16:53.846 --> 16:56.849
It's like darkness.
But it's a dark shadow...

16:56.849 --> 16:58.551
heavier than darkness...

16:58.551 --> 17:04.157
It chased down my fellow
demons and devoured them...

17:04.157 --> 17:07.456
It seems that's how it
builds up its power...

17:11.230 --> 17:13.858
What an interesting
conversation...

17:17.136 --> 17:20.401
Let's cut the nonsense,
shall we?

17:22.375 --> 17:23.543
Banban!

17:23.543 --> 17:25.278
Was this what you saw
in your dream?

17:25.278 --> 17:27.847
Yes, there's no doubt
about it...

17:27.847 --> 17:31.476
It's Banban, the foreign demon
from the Sengaikyou.

17:35.221 --> 17:36.984
It's going to attack!

17:48.201 --> 17:50.066
How could you do that?!

17:53.673 --> 17:56.665
Stop it! Why are you
doing this?!

17:57.643 --> 18:02.382
You say strange things. It's
their fate to be killed by us.

18:02.382 --> 18:05.545
Whether it's sooner or later,
the end is the same.

18:07.186 --> 18:08.881
Stop!

18:19.265 --> 18:22.602
- Stop! Stop killing them!
- Please!

18:22.602 --> 18:24.968
Please! Get rid of him!

18:27.840 --> 18:31.503
[chant]

18:46.626 --> 18:48.321
Masahiro!

18:49.462 --> 18:51.464
By imperial command
of the Jade Emperor,

18:51.464 --> 18:53.625
charm of the sacred treasure,
bind this evil!

18:55.368 --> 18:59.304
Entrap ten thousand demons. Now!

19:06.646 --> 19:08.136
All right!

19:15.888 --> 19:18.118
He... He did it!

19:30.002 --> 19:33.272
Those like you are
nothing more...

19:33.272 --> 19:36.843
than worms in front
of my master...

19:36.843 --> 19:39.676
Be told that there's
no salvation for you!

19:40.446 --> 19:42.209
You scum!

19:46.452 --> 19:49.288
It broke my spell
and got away...

19:49.288 --> 19:52.849
With injuries like that,
it couldn't have gone far...

19:56.195 --> 19:58.959
Maybe it went back to
its master's place...

20:00.199 --> 20:03.102
The more terrifying demon
you talked about...

20:03.102 --> 20:04.871
Do you know where
it's gone?

20:04.871 --> 20:07.473
It headed towards
Ukyou back then.

20:07.473 --> 20:09.842
But I don't know
where exactly.

20:09.842 --> 20:11.310
I know, I know!

20:11.310 --> 20:14.113
A huge house outside Ukyou!

20:14.113 --> 20:16.115
I saw it go inside.

20:16.115 --> 20:19.619
I used to live there.

20:19.619 --> 20:21.416
Really?!

20:32.298 --> 20:33.959
This is it...

20:34.934 --> 20:36.903
There's something strange here.

20:36.903 --> 20:40.498
- There're no sounds of insects.
- That's true.

20:45.444 --> 20:48.971
This silence makes it
even more suspicious...

20:51.884 --> 20:54.375
- What is it?
- This is...

20:55.254 --> 20:56.949
That's...

20:57.056 --> 20:58.853
Gouetsu!

20:59.659 --> 21:01.490
It can't be helped.

21:01.928 --> 21:04.123
I guess I'll offer this body.

21:04.997 --> 21:06.521
It...

21:06.566 --> 21:09.268
really offered its body...

21:09.268 --> 21:13.637
It gave up on me and offered
its own body to its master...

21:16.776 --> 21:18.368
Masahiro!

21:42.401 --> 21:53.779
Fukai yami no naka de kimi
no koe ga kikoeta

21:53.779 --> 22:05.291
"Shinjiteru" tada hitokoto boku
no kokoro ni hibiite kita

22:05.291 --> 22:10.997
Itsumo kimi ga soba ni
ite kureta ne

22:10.997 --> 22:16.526
Itsumo boku ni yuuki kurete ita

22:18.804 --> 22:29.181
Boku-tachi no mirai wo
mamoritsuzukeru tame ni

22:29.181 --> 22:35.848
Taisetsu na kimi ni
yakusokusuru yo

